flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Input[/Read config file/]
    Input --> Valid{Is config valid?}
    Valid -->|Yes| Load[Load plugins]
    Valid -->|No| Err[Report error]
    Err --> Stop((Stop))
    Load --> Cache[(Plugin cache)]
    Load --> Run[[Run pipeline]]
    subgraph Pipeline
        direction LR
        Run --> Lint{{Lint}}
        Lint --> Build>Build artifacts]
        Build --> Test[Run tests]
    end
    Test -.->|flaky| Run
    Test ==>|green| Deploy[Deploy]
    Deploy --> Stop
    classDef warn fill:#fdd,stroke:#c33
    class Err warn
